# Llama 3 8B at its full size on one node of 8 GPUs: every parameter, and its share of
# AdamW's state, split 8 ways (FSDP), computing in bfloat16 with float32 parameters,
# its 32 blocks scanned (one compiled block, not 32) and rematerialized in the
# backward, and each step's 256 rows taken 64 at a time.
#
#   bux plan   examples/experiments/parallel/fsdp_8b.bux    # its GPUs, bytes on each
#   bux launch examples/experiments/parallel/fsdp_8b.bux
use llama3_8b
use fineweb_wsd

mesh      = mesh(fsdp=8)
precision = precision(compute=bfloat16)
methods   = methods(repeat=scan, remat=dots, microbatches=4)
